{"seq":3,"slug":"rounding-allocation-currency-precision","title":"取整规则、费用分摊与多币种精度：金额舍入策略与分摊残差处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/charge-basis-rate-card-engine/rounding-allocation-currency-precision","wordCount":3184,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"取整规则-费用分摊与多币种精度-金额舍入策略与分摊残差处理\">取整规则、费用分摊与多币种精度：金额舍入策略与分摊残差处理</h1><p>一笔 19.99 USD 的订单，佣金费率 15%，应记佣金是 2.9985 USD。账本里存 3.00 还是 2.99，看似只是末位差别，但乘以每天百万级订单、再叠加退款、调账与多币种结算后，口径不一致会直接演变成卖家对账失败和平台side 的应收缺口。取整层不是&quot;最后一位小数的美化&quot;，而是一套必须<strong>确定性、可复现、可审计</strong>的数值契约。本文讨论它的四个核心问题：用什么数据类型、用哪种舍入模式、分摊余数给谁、多币种换算链的精度如何不丢失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要设计取整层，先区分三个常被混为一谈的量：<strong>币种最小单位（minor unit）</strong>、<strong>业务精度（business scale）</strong>、<strong>展示精度（display scale）</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>币种最小单位</strong>由 ISO 4217 定义，是该币种法定可表示的最小面额。美元是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，日元是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，科威特第纳尔是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。ISO 4217 的 decimal exponent 列明确了每个币种的位数：0 位的有 BIF、CLP、DJF、GNF、ISK、JPY、KMF、KRW、PYG、RWF、UGX、VND 等；3 位的有 BHD、IQD、JOD、KWD、LYD、OMR、TND；4 位的有 CLF、UYW（funds code，非交易货币）（来源：ISO 4217 现行币种表，经 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217 转述）。</li>\n<li><strong>业务精度</strong>是计算过程中保留的中间位数，通常高于币种最小单位，用于避免连锁舍入误差。</li>\n<li><strong>展示精度</strong>是对账单上打印出来的位数，必须回落到币种最小单位。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者关系可钉死为一句话：<strong>计算阶段用高精度，落账时刻用币种最小单位做唯一一次舍入，展示只做格式化不做数值变更</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;原始金额&lt;br/&gt;19.99 USD&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;高精度计算&lt;br/&gt;decimal(28,10)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;佣金 = 19.99 x 0.15&lt;br/&gt;= 2.9985&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;需要落账的最小单位&lt;br/&gt;USD = 10^-2&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;一个订单&quot;| E[&quot;舍入到 3.00 USD&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;整批分摊&quot;| F[&quot;按分母分摊&lt;br/&gt;余数按最大余数法分配&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;账本条目&lt;br/&gt;不可再舍入&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;对账单展示&lt;br/&gt;2 位小数格式化&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"原始金额&lt;br/&gt;19.99 USD\"] --&gt; B[\"高精度计算&lt;br/&gt;decimal(28,10)\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"佣金 = 19.99 x 0.15&lt;br/&gt;= 2.9985\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"需要落账的最小单位&lt;br/&gt;USD = 10^-2\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"一个订单\"| E[\"舍入到 3.00 USD\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"整批分摊\"| F[\"按分母分摊&lt;br/&gt;余数按最大余数法分配\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"账本条目&lt;br/&gt;不可再舍入\"]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[\"对账单展示&lt;br/&gt;2 位小数格式化\"]</pre><p>不同币种的精度差异不是理论边角案例。Stripe 的币种文档把 HUF、TWD 标为&quot;可按 2 位小数计费、但提现时按 0 位小数处理&quot;的特殊案例：HUF 余额 10.45 时只能提现 100 的整数倍，即 <code>amount=1000</code> 提 10 HUF，<code>amount=1045</code> 会被拒绝（来源：docs.stripe.com/currencies 特殊案例表）。这意味着<strong>同一币种在计费侧和资金侧可以有不同精度</strong>，引擎必须把&quot;计费精度&quot;与&quot;可提现精度&quot;建模为两个独立字段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>币种</th>\n<th>ISO 4217 指数</th>\n<th>计费示例（15% 佣金）</th>\n<th>常见陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>USD</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>19.99 → 3.00</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JPY</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2000 → 300</td>\n<td>传入小数直接报错（PayPal 明确拒绝）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KWD</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>19.990 → 2.999</td>\n<td>2 位库会截断第三位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HUF</td>\n<td>2（计费）/ 0（提现）</td>\n<td>1000.45 计费、提现取整</td>\n<td>需双精度字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISK</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>兼容期仍写 <code>500</code> = 5 ISK</td>\n<td>表示位与语义位不一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"金额数据类型与舍入模式\">金额数据类型与舍入模式</h2><p>金额绝不能用 binary64 存储。IEEE 754 的 binary64 是二进制浮点，无法精确表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span></span></span></span></span> 这类十进制小数，累加会产生可见漂移。ISO/IEC/IEEE 60559（即 IEEE 754）另设了十进制浮点格式 decimal32/decimal64/decimal128，其中 decimal128 提供 34 位十进制有效数字、指数范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6143</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-6143</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">6143</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>6144</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+6144</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">6144</span></span></span></span></span>，标准文本明确指出它面向&quot;必须精确复现十进制舍入&quot;的金融与税务计算（来源：IEEE 754 decimal128 格式，见 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decimal128_floating-point_format）。工程上两种主流落地是定点十进制整数（金额存为最小单位的整数，1999 表示 19.99 USD）和高精度 decimal 类型（PostgreSQL <code>numeric(28,10)</code>、Java <code>BigDecimal</code>、Python <code>decimal</code>），区别在于是否显式携带标度。</p>\n<p>舍入模式必须显式指定，不能依赖语言默认行为，因为默认值在不同栈上并不一致。常见的六种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>平局行为</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23.5</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>23.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-23.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">23.5</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>half up</td>\n<td>取较大值</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>-23</td>\n<td>部分税务场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>half down</td>\n<td>取较小值</td>\n<td>23</td>\n<td>-24</td>\n<td>罕见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>half away from zero</td>\n<td>绝对值变大</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>-24</td>\n<td>&quot;商业舍入&quot;，最直觉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>half to even</td>\n<td>取最近偶数</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>-24</td>\n<td>IEEE 754 默认，统计无偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>half toward zero</td>\n<td>绝对值变小</td>\n<td>23</td>\n<td>-23</td>\n<td>截断式分账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stochastic</td>\n<td>按概率随机</td>\n<td>随机</td>\n<td>随机</td>\n<td>机器学习、超大规模摊销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>half to even（银行家舍入）之所以被 IEEE 754 选为默认 tie-breaking，是因为它在正负两侧都无偏，长期大量累加时不会系统性偏向某一方向（来源：en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rounding）。但&quot;无偏&quot;不等于&quot;符合监管&quot;：多数增值税辖区要求<strong>逐行</strong>舍入到最小单位，而非先汇总再舍入，此时 half away from zero 往往更贴近审计预期。</p>\n<p>这里必须点出一个高频缺陷：<strong>双重舍入（double rounding）</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.46</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9.46</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.46</span></span></span></span></span> 先舍到一位小数得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.5</span></span></span></span></span>，再舍到整数得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>；而直接舍到整数应得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>，原因是第一步把一个非平局值变成了平局。防御做法是计算全程用高精度，只在写入账本那一刻做唯一一次舍入，任何&quot;先四舍五入到分再继续算&quot;的写法都要在审查中拦下。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊残差与最大余数法\">分摊残差与最大余数法</h2><p>当一笔费用要拆给多方——平台佣金、支付通道费、物流补贴、多 SKU 佣金归属——就出现守恒问题：各份之和必须精确等于总额。朴素的&quot;每份各自舍入&quot;必然破坏守恒。设总额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 按权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>T</mi><mtext>（一般情形）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = T \\cdot \\frac{w_i}{\\sum_{j=1}^{n} w_j}, \\qquad \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\text{round}(s_i) \\neq T \\text{（一般情形）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（一般情形）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>解法是<strong>最大余数法（largest remainder / Hamilton 法）</strong>：先给每份取整数部分（向下取整），再按小数余数从大到小把剩余单位逐一分配，直到分完（来源：en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Largest_remainder_method），从而保证总和严格守恒。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>例（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,1,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>计算精确份额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33.333</mn><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33.333\\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33.333</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>取整数部分</td>\n<td>各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span></span></span></span></span>，已分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>算余数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i-\\lfloor s_i \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.333</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.333</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.333</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>余下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 份按余数最大者优先分配</td>\n<td>第一份得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">34</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">34</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>34</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>33</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>33</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[34,33,33]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">34</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键工程细节是<strong>平局时给谁</strong>。多份余数完全相同时（上例三份都是 0.333），必须有确定性的 tie-break：通常按&quot;分摊方标识的稳定排序&quot;取最早的一个，而不是依赖数据库返回顺序或哈希遍历顺序——后者会让同一笔交易在重算时得到不同结果，破坏幂等性。另一个细节是<strong>余数符号</strong>：退款场景金额为负，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor \\cdot \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 的方向会反转，必须显式定义&quot;余数按绝对值排序&quot;还是&quot;按带符号值排序&quot;。</p>\n<p>最大余数法满足配额规则，但有著名的<strong>阿拉巴马悖论</strong>：总份额增加时某一份反而减少。对于按累计流水动态分成的场景，这个非单调性会造成&quot;卖家当月多卖了、分成反而少了&quot;的观感。缓解手段是把分摊基数冻结在结算周期开始时，而不是在周期内滚动重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多币种换汇链的精度管理\">多币种换汇链的精度管理</h2><p>跨境市场的费用经常跨币种：订单以 EUR 计价，佣金按 USD 费率卡计算，最终以 USD 结算给卖家。这条链上至少要定义四个量：报价币种、计费币种、结算币种，以及汇率的方向与精度。Stripe Connect 文档描述了这条链的三个转换触发点：交易币种与结算币种不同时、平台余额币种与关联账户余额币种不同时、以及平台手续费（application fee）本身的换汇（来源：docs.stripe.com/connect/currencies）。业内常见做法是使用第三方报价的市场中间价（mid-market rate），并在特定情形（政府强制汇率、供应商间价差过大）改用平台自持汇率以管理风险。</p>\n<p>换汇的精度陷阱在于<strong>汇率本身的标度</strong>。EUR/USD = 1.08435 若被截断成 1.08，10000 EUR 就会产生 43.5 USD 的误差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>fx</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>scale</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>target_currency</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>HALF_UP</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{target}} = \\text{round}\\left(A_{\\text{source}} \\times R_{\\text{fx}},\\; \\text{scale}(\\text{target\\_currency}),\\; \\text{HALF\\_UP}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">source</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fx</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scale</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">target_currency</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HALF_UP</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>fx</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{fx}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fx</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的存储精度应显著高于目标币种精度（工程上常取 8–12 位），且必须与舍入模式一起记录进审计日志。换算后立即舍入到目标币种最小单位，后续不再对同一笔金额重复换算——反复&quot;换过去再换回来&quot;会因舍入不可逆而丢失金额，这是跨月调账里最隐蔽的资金缺口来源。</p>\n<p>汇率锁定是另一个必须建模的状态。若下单时锁定汇率、结算时才入账，账本必须同时保存&quot;锁定汇率&quot;与&quot;入账汇率&quot;，并在二者不一致时产生汇兑损益条目，而不是悄悄用其中之一的金额覆盖另一者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"税务拆分与逐行舍入\">税务拆分与逐行舍入</h2><p>税务是取整层压力最大的场景，因为它同时约束&quot;精度&quot;和&quot;顺序&quot;。多数增值税辖区要求<strong>按行（per-line）计算税额并逐行舍入</strong>，而不是对整张发票的小计算一次税再舍入——后者在行数多时会产生可观的尾差，且与监管申报口径不符。设税率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、行金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>scale</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>HALF_UP</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i = \\text{round}\\left(a_i \\cdot \\frac{r}{1+r},\\; \\text{scale},\\; \\text{HALF\\_UP}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scale</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HALF_UP</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意区分<strong>价内税</strong>（含税价拆出税额，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>）与<strong>价外税</strong>（税额外加），混用会让对账总额漂移。当一行内包含多个计税组（不同税率商品混装）时，拆分必须复用最大余数法，保证各税率组成之和等于行税额。</p>\n<p>欧盟层面并没有统一的分币舍入法规，各成员国按本国税法规定舍入方向与位数；欧盟 VAT 法规只规定标准税率下限（15%）和优惠税率下限（通常 5%）（来源：en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Value-added_tax）。这意味着取整规则必须是<strong>可配置的按辖区数据</strong>，而非硬编码常量：每个税务辖区一条记录，声明舍入模式、舍入节点（逐行 / 逐发票）与位数。新开一个市场时只需新增一条数据，不必改代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计与可复现舍入\">审计与可复现舍入</h2><p>取整层的最终验收标准是<strong>同一笔输入在任何时间、任何节点、任何批次重算都得到逐位相同的输出</strong>。这要求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>金额与标度显式存储</strong>。账本字段自带 precision 与 scale，不依赖运行时推断。</li>\n<li><strong>舍入模式随金额落库</strong>。审计时能看到&quot;这笔 3.00 是用 half up 从 2.9985 得到的&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>中间精度固定</strong>。计算链上所有乘除法统一到同一个高精度标度，禁止各模块自定义。</li>\n<li><strong>分摊结果可复现</strong>。tie-break 使用稳定标识排序，不用集合遍历顺序。</li>\n<li><strong>舍入只发生一次</strong>。&quot;重算&quot;必须从原始输入重走完整条链，不能在已舍入结果上再算。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这几条构成可复现舍入的契约，也是 IEEE 754 decimal128 &quot;必须精确复现&quot;要求的工程落地（来源：en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decimal128_floating-point_format）。缺少任一条，卖家对账时提出的&quot;你的佣金比我自己算的多一分钱&quot;就无法给出可验证的回答。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三个精度必须分开建模</strong>：币种最小单位（ISO 4217 指数量化，如 USD=2、JPY=0、KWD=3）、业务精度（计算中间量）、展示精度（格式化）。HUF、TWD 这类&quot;计费 2 位、提现 0 位&quot;的币种尤其需要双字段。</li>\n<li><strong>金额用十进制，绝不用 binary64</strong>。定点整数或 decimal 类型；IEEE 754 decimal128 是标准给出的 34 位十进制金融格式。</li>\n<li><strong>舍入模式显式声明</strong>：half to even 无偏、half away from zero 直觉、逐行税务舍入常被监管要求；不同栈默认值不一致，不能依赖默认。</li>\n<li><strong>避免双重舍入</strong>：高精度计算，落账时唯一一次舍入。</li>\n<li><strong>分摊用最大余数法保证守恒</strong>，tie-break 必须确定性，注意负金额与&quot;阿拉巴马悖论&quot;的非单调性。</li>\n<li><strong>换汇链只换算一次并立即舍入</strong>，汇率标度显著高于币种精度，锁定汇率与入账汇率分别留痕。</li>\n<li><strong>税区取整规则是可配置数据</strong>：欧盟无统一分币法规，按辖区配置模式、节点、位数。</li>\n<li>取整策略应作为费率卡解析结果的组成部分；费率卡本身的层级与匹配逻辑见 <code>./2_rate-card-model-category-hierarchy.md</code>，取整后的金额如何进入幂等的计费流程见 <code>../2_fee-calculation-charge-engine/1_charge-engine-architecture-idempotency.md</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"取整规则、费用分摊与多币种精度：金额舍入策略与分摊残差处理","id":"取整规则-费用分摊与多币种精度-金额舍入策略与分摊残差处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"金额数据类型与舍入模式","id":"金额数据类型与舍入模式"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊残差与最大余数法","id":"分摊残差与最大余数法"},{"level":2,"text":"多币种换汇链的精度管理","id":"多币种换汇链的精度管理"},{"level":2,"text":"税务拆分与逐行舍入","id":"税务拆分与逐行舍入"},{"level":2,"text":"审计与可复现舍入","id":"审计与可复现舍入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"费率卡数据模型：费用类目层级、条件/阶梯费率与生效版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/charge-basis-rate-card-engine/rate-card-model-category-hierarchy"},"next":{"title":"计费引擎架构：事件驱动的费用生成、幂等与重算机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/fee-calculation-charge-engine/charge-engine-architecture-idempotency"}}